{
    "title": "GRUBL\u2122 4D Live Wallpapers + AI",
    "description": "Find cool live wallpapers in 4K, 4D, and 3D that fit your style! Decorate your home and lock screen with beautiful wallpapers simultaneously. Experience a new dimension of 4k, 4D, and 3D wallpapers.\r\n\r\n<h1>Live Wallpaper Maker in 4D, 3D and 4K!</h1>\r\nDiscover a revolutionary way to personalize your device with stunning and unique wallpapers for android. Our app offers an extensive selection of 4D live wallpapers that will give your phone a futuristic and cutting-edge look.\r\n\r\n<h2>Upgrade your device with stunning 4D and 4K wallpaper!</h2>\r\n\r\n<b>Create wallpapers with the power of Artificial intelligence! </b>\r\nEnter a description, pick a style, and let the magic begin! Watch your idea turn into a unique piece of AI-generated art in seconds. Browse the public AI Gallery to see what others created.\r\n\r\n<b>Discover fantastic ringtones with GRUBL\u2122!</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd37Enjoy popular & funny ringtones, alarms & notification sounds.\r\nHundreds of free ringtones are now available to change how your phone rings. Choose your favorite ringtone, notification, and alarm sound from many categories like music, funny, sound effects, Bollywood, animals, and many more. You can even set a different ringtone for each contact.\r\n\r\n<b>18 categories - 1000+ animated backgrounds powered by AI.</b>\r\nEnjoy popular 4D animated backgrounds from categories like VFX, AMOLED, nature - animals, anime, space & planets, characters live wallpapers in 4D, for gamers, video wallpapers, and many more!\r\n\r\n<h2>Experience cutting-edge AI technology with our 4D, 4K, and 3D wallpapers collection.</h2>\r\n<b>Unleash the power of AI on your device with our 3D, 4D, and 4K wallpapers.</b>\r\nWith GRUBL\u2122, your phone will become the eye-catching conversation starter, transforming your screen into an epic 3D and 4D moving entertainment experience with outstanding effects.\r\n\r\n<h2>New live wallpapers for free!</h2>\r\nYou will get new live wallpapers every week, with realistic effects, a preview for each theme (even for 4D), and adjustments for each background independently.\r\n\r\nEnable the auto-changer to randomly pick a live wallpaper for your lock screen or home screen each time your screen goes on, every 6 hours, or daily.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd37Search GRUBL\u2122 for your favorite live wallpaper by color.\r\nUse color-search to create a personal look for your phone based on your favorite colors.\r\n\r\nAMOLED true wallpaper color.\r\nGet the most out of your AMOLED screen with designed mind-blowing 3D wallpapers that move - especially see space & characters live wallpapers.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd37 Use your videos as live wallpapers.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd37 True depth 4D wallpaper effect.\r\nReal characters become alive with GRUBL\u2122.\r\nEpic superheroes, movie scenes, funny characters, and exploding 4D space themes are ready to pop out of your screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd37 Video wallpapers & cinemagraphs.\r\nExperience a natural motion effect in 4D, with animated 3D wallpapers combined with visual effects layers like snow, rain, fire effects, smoke, and many more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd37 Device friendly.\r\nWith the battery consumption between 0.5% and 2%, you will see no difference in your phone's daily usage.\r\nGRUBL\u2122 is designed to be very lightweight and battery friendly and completely stops when the screen goes off. Video wallpapers may use a little more of your battery. \u2705\r\n\r\nEvery live wallpaper is designed and auto-adjusted to fit any aspect ratio, including ultra-wide screens, and tested with the most popular devices such as Samsung Galaxy, OnePlus, Xiaomi, etc.\r\n\r\n<h1>Make each time you check your phone an absolute pleasure</h1>\r\nMake each time your phone rings unique.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find cool live wallpapers in 4K, 4D, and 3D that fit your style! Decorate your home and lock screen with beautiful wallpapers simultaneously. Experience a new dimension of 4k, 4D, and 3D wallpapers.<br><br><h1>Live Wallpaper Maker in 4D, 3D and 4K!</h1><br>Discover a revolutionary way to personalize your device with stunning and unique wallpapers for android. Our app offers an extensive selection of 4D live wallpapers that will give your phone a futuristic and cutting-edge look.<br><br><h2>Upgrade your device with stunning 4D and 4K wallpaper!</h2><br><br><b>Create wallpapers with the power of Artificial intelligence! </b><br>Enter a description, pick a style, and let the magic begin! Watch your idea turn into a unique piece of AI-generated art in seconds. Browse the public AI Gallery to see what others created.<br><br><b>Discover fantastic ringtones with GRUBL\u2122!</b><br>\ud83d\udd37Enjoy popular &amp; funny ringtones, alarms &amp; notification sounds.<br>Hundreds of free ringtones are now available to change how your phone rings. Choose your favorite ringtone, notification, and alarm sound from many categories like music, funny, sound effects, Bollywood, animals, and many more. You can even set a different ringtone for each contact.<br><br><b>18 categories - 1000+ animated backgrounds powered by AI.</b><br>Enjoy popular 4D animated backgrounds from categories like VFX, AMOLED, nature - animals, anime, space &amp; planets, characters live wallpapers in 4D, for gamers, video wallpapers, and many more!<br><br><h2>Experience cutting-edge AI technology with our 4D, 4K, and 3D wallpapers collection.</h2><br><b>Unleash the power of AI on your device with our 3D, 4D, and 4K wallpapers.</b><br>With GRUBL\u2122, your phone will become the eye-catching conversation starter, transforming your screen into an epic 3D and 4D moving entertainment experience with outstanding effects.<br><br><h2>New live wallpapers for free!</h2><br>You will get new live wallpapers every week, with realistic effects, a preview for each theme (even for 4D), and adjustments for each background independently.<br><br>Enable the auto-changer to randomly pick a live wallpaper for your lock screen or home screen each time your screen goes on, every 6 hours, or daily.<br><br>\ud83d\udd37Search GRUBL\u2122 for your favorite live wallpaper by color.<br>Use color-search to create a personal look for your phone based on your favorite colors.<br><br>AMOLED true wallpaper color.<br>Get the most out of your AMOLED screen with designed mind-blowing 3D wallpapers that move - especially see space &amp; characters live wallpapers.<br><br>\ud83d\udd37 Use your videos as live wallpapers.<br><br>\ud83d\udd37 True depth 4D wallpaper effect.<br>Real characters become alive with GRUBL\u2122.<br>Epic superheroes, movie scenes, funny characters, and exploding 4D space themes are ready to pop out of your screen.<br><br>\ud83d\udd37 Video wallpapers &amp; cinemagraphs.<br>Experience a natural motion effect in 4D, with animated 3D wallpapers combined with visual effects layers like snow, rain, fire effects, smoke, and many more.<br><br>\ud83d\udd37 Device friendly.<br>With the battery consumption between 0.5% and 2%, you will see no difference in your phone&#39;s daily usage.<br>GRUBL\u2122 is designed to be very lightweight and battery friendly and completely stops when the screen goes off. Video wallpapers may use a little more of your battery. \u2705<br><br>Every live wallpaper is designed and auto-adjusted to fit any aspect ratio, including ultra-wide screens, and tested with the most popular devices such as Samsung Galaxy, OnePlus, Xiaomi, etc.<br><br><h1>Make each time you check your phone an absolute pleasure</h1><br>Make each time your phone rings unique.",
